ur=200&s=a0a29a905a8eaf9029ba99ebb99c4536, https://si.imgix.net/7271cce2/uploads/origins/d73bf912-b620-4dd4-b99f-9df252ec7aab?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=aed231559128586850722ff7b4c27024 2x, https://si.imgix.net/7271cce2/uploads/origins/d73bf912-b620-4dd4-b99f-9df252ec7aab?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=6df2dbac88768e799143357139830bd0 3x"}, "body": "My friend's vtuber company is closing and she is getting to keep her character. I want an art piece to celebrate this. My idea is her past vtuber characters are welcoming her to the family like \"welcome home\". I've worked with you in the past and loved your work so I would be very happy if you could help make this real. I've attached a reference for the idea. Thank you very much!\n\n友人のVTuber事務所が閉鎖することになり、彼女は自身のキャラクターを引き継ぐことになりました。これを記念するアート作品が欲しいのです。過去のVTuberキャラクターたちが「おかえり」と家族のように彼女を迎え入れるイメージを考えています。以前もお仕事させていただき、素晴らしい作品に感動しました。ぜひこの構想を実現していただければ幸いです。参考画像を添付しました。よろしくお願いいたします！\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/Kq2VEpU\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/Kq2VEpU\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/Kq2VEpU", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@PZit94/works/5", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3562356, "client_id": 357553, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/cee71922/uploads/origins/d269ca61-4eb8-40b9-86f0-c3fb460de0c3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=95feaeb8228fc7db1cfa37c4824ec046", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/cee71922/uploads/origins/d269ca61-4eb8-40b9-86f0-c3fb460de0c3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=95feaeb8228fc7db1cfa37c4824ec046, https://si.imgix.net/cee71922/uploads/origins/d269ca61-4eb8-40b9-86f0-c3fb460de0c3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=